---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Oscar Frias is a mechanical engineer and technical lead who develops complex machines and robotic systems.">
  <h1>Hi, I'm Oscar, I build complex machines.</h1>
  <p class="intro">
    I’m a mechanical engineer and technical lead working across robotics, electromechanical systems,
    manufacturing, and product development—from early architecture through validation and deployment.
  </p>
  <section class="principles" aria-label="How I work">
    <article><span>01</span><h2>Technical leadership</h2><p>I turn ambiguous programs into architectures, decisions, plans, and validated systems. I build alignment across disciplines while keeping technical ownership and engineering risk visible.</p></article>
    <article><span>02</span><h2>Machine development</h2><p>I work across mechanisms, structures, actuators, sensors, manufacturing, reliability, and system integration. I am most effective where analysis, prototypes, testing, and practical judgment meet.</p></article>
    <article><span>03</span><h2>Engineering in context</h2><p>A machine succeeds as part of a larger system. I account for the people who build, operate, service, and depend on it—along with production constraints, business goals, and real-world failure modes.</p></article>
  </section>
  <nav class="next-links" aria-label="Explore the site">
    <a href="/projects/">Explore my work <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    <a href="/resume/">View experience <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    <a href="/writing/">Browse writing <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </nav>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .principles {
    margin-top: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
    border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .principles article {
    min-height: 11rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 4rem minmax(12rem, 0.65fr) 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: start;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .principles span {
    color: var(--signal);
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 750;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "Arial Narrow", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 3.1rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    line-height: 0.95;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .principles p {
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin: 0;
    color: #4d565d;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .next-links {
    margin-top: 4rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .next-links a {
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .next-links a + a { border-left: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .next-links a:hover { color: var(--paper); background: var(--signal); }

  @media (max-width: 44rem) {
    .principles article { grid-template-columns: 2.5rem 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
    .principles p { grid-column: 2; }
    .next-links { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .next-links a + a { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); border-left: 0; }
  }
</style>